@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2

title Общая схема взаимодействия агентов WatchDog-MAS

actor "Внешний источник\n(External System)" as External
participant "Auditor\n(agent_auditor)" as Auditor
database "Redis Pub/Sub\n(localhost:6379)" as Redis
participant "Coordinator\n(agent_coordinator)" as Coordinator
participant "DeepSeek LLM\n(deepseek-v4-pro)" as LLM
participant "Analyzer\n(agent_analyzator)" as Analyzer
collections "Сканеры\n(ThreadPoolExecutor)" as Scanners

== 1. Получение подсетей ==
External -> Redis : publish(["192.168.1.0/24", ...])\nканал: externalReceive
Redis --> Auditor : subscribe: externalReceive\nвозвращает список подсетей

== 2. Сканирование сети ==
Auditor -> Auditor : queue.put(subnets)\n→ execute_analyze_subnet()
Auditor -> Scanners : ThreadPoolExecutor\nsubnet_thread_analyze(subnet)\nnmap -sS -sV -F -T4 --privileged
Scanners --> Auditor : {host: {port: {proto, service, version}}}

== 3. Передача результатов координатору ==
Auditor -> Redis : publish(host_results)\nканал: auditor-coordinator
Redis --> Coordinator : subscribe: auditor-coordinator\nqueue_auditor.put(data)

== 4. Принятие решений через LLM ==
Coordinator -> Coordinator : await queue_auditor.get()
Coordinator -> LLM : chat.completions.create(\n  model="deepseek-v4-pro",\n  messages=[SYSTEM_PROMPT, user_data],\n  response_format={type: "json_object"}\n)
LLM --> Coordinator : JSON: {IP: {ports, scripts,\n  global_scripts, scanner, ping,\n  scan_speed, intensity}}

== 5. Отправка инструкций анализатору ==
Coordinator -> Redis : publish(scan_instructions)\nканал: coordinator-analyze
Redis --> Analyzer : subscribe: coordinator-analyze\nget_data_from_agent()

== 6. Выполнение сканирования уязвимостей ==
Analyzer -> Analyzer : for each IP: выбирает стратегию\n(NmapScannerStrategy / Nuclei / SearchSplot)
Analyzer -> Scanners : ThreadPoolExecutor\ninstructions_for_agent_execute()
Scanners -> Scanners : nmap --script <scripts>\n-T <speed> --version-intensity <depth>
Scanners --> Analyzer : [{host, port, cves: [...]}, ...]

== 7. Возврат результатов ==
Analyzer -> Redis : publish(vuln_results)\nканал: analyze-coordinator
Redis --> Coordinator : subscribe: analyze-coordinator\nqueue_analyze.put(data)

== 8. Периодическое пересканирование (Auditor) ==
Auditor -> Auditor : analyze_subnet_timer()\nкаждые 30 сек: ping_scan vs known_hosts\nпри изменениях → пересканирование

@enduml
